// expect-error: extern.param_abi
// An owned array crosses a verified call by moving; an audited extern has no
// such rule to rely on. The ABI carries integers, raw pointers, and
// whitelisted resources, and a safe array is none of them.

extern "C" #[audit(id := "test.owned.arr.v1", reason := "no layout")]
fn c_consume([u8] a);
